      "uid": "zhcn:35faa1257536656157950582",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "母亲是在美国广为人知的名门马娘，\n父亲是实业家。两人都曾在日本的\n一家培养赛马娘的俱乐部工作——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b857cd4e06a9213129de19da34e0b64a0a20e2cc96796d71a385df3d405ea29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
