      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后强烈感受到，\n在此成为女王就是自己的命运。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b090be21184b81f3f57618593228713b7ec2f52011c7e72e43c7caa3ffb0fc1",
